---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = '16 November 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Flintora collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through this website.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" lines={['Privacy', 'policy.']} lead={`Last updated ${updated}.`} crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' }]} />
  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p><em>This policy is a starting template. Have it reviewed by a qualified adviser for the jurisdictions you operate in before launch.</em></p>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>{site.name} ("we", "us") operates this website. You can contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you use the contact form or email us, we receive your name, email address, phone number, company and the details of your enquiry.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> If you accept analytics cookies, Google Analytics collects information about how you use the site, such as pages visited, device type and approximate location. IP addresses are anonymised.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data.</strong> Our hosting provider may log IP addresses and browser details for security and performance.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your enquiry and provide our services.</li>
        <li>To understand and improve how the website is used.</li>
        <li>To meet legal and accounting obligations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>
      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>We use trusted providers to run this site, including our website host, a form processing service that delivers contact form messages to our inbox, and Google Analytics where you have consented. They process data on our behalf and only as needed to provide their service.</p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>The site works without cookies. Analytics cookies are only set if you accept them in the consent banner. Your choice is stored in your browser, and you can clear it at any time through your browser settings.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep data</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry details for as long as needed to respond and, if you become a client, for the duration of our relationship and any legal retention period afterwards.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict use of your personal information, and to object to processing. To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
